    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e74c467bf7f7d9744cca90b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她追向抢先飞奔而出的胜利奖券\n和成田大进，也跑了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e809746c5b4e47d42ccc26b9711f4ff099984b62fab252378d1847a3459c32fe",
