    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18862c73e6d0e9575965533",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田大进与胜利奖券似乎预定要参加\n新马级的GⅠ“希望锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf6912c854b43cecf4dba460a00753c5272c1bc3470165f056122750456e1d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
