    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a57adfa15733cbb10d992123",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然跟琵琶晨光参加的“朝日杯FS”不同，\n但一样是GⅠ。\n……是新马级最高阶的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6093ce454f35962e68fe9efb8da4ef7dc5e787daf57533eb95726371207ac7df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
