      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来强力的劲敌并非只有\n总有一天会碰到的成田白仁而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b3870309af516bd4c1020b6e94ee8eb9f90b8fcc2501c4d02682c5d9f54298",
